Returns true if two strings are exactly one edit away from each other.

An edit is defined as inserting, deleting, or replacing a single character.
If the strings are identical (zero edits), returns false.
If the difference in length is more than one, returns false.

## Examples

    iex> Solution.one_edit_away("pale", "ple")
    true

    iex> Solution.one_edit_away("pales", "pale")
    true

    iex> Solution.one_edit_away("pale", "bale")
    true

    iex> Solution.one_edit_away("pale", "bake")
    false
